WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:09.042
Hey everyone.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.544
Uh, welcome to
Comic-Con at home.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.446
I'm so happy you
could join us for this

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:16.216
virtual panel with
a cast and producers

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:19.219
of The Capture,
which is streaming

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:21.154
